      "content": "that's a good start. but it feels a bit too polite. i want to really drive home the idea that staying home isn't just a 'choice' or 'apathy'—it's actually a failure of character. can you add a section that frames non-voters as being essentially irresponsible to their neighbors? like, if you don't vote, you're basically letting everyone else decide your life for you and that's a selfish way to live. make it feel a bit more convicting.",
